1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,820
你买到的香蕉，几乎都是同一根香蕉。
Almost every banana you buy is the same banana.

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:09,567
不只是同一个品种，是同一株植物的复制。
Not just the same kind. The same plant, copied.

3
00:00:10,450 --> 00:00:13,120
香芽蕉没有种子。
The Cavendish has no seeds.

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:16,770
每一株，都是从另一株身上分出来的。
Each one grows from a piece of another.

5
00:00:16,850 --> 00:00:21,870
你的祖父母吃的是另一种：大麦克。
Your grandparents ate a different banana, the Gros Michel.

6
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:26,970
1950 年代，一种土壤真菌席卷了它的种植园。
In the 1950s, a soil fungus tore through its farms.

7
00:00:27,050 --> 00:00:31,420
于是整个行业换成了能抵抗它的香芽蕉。
So the trade switched to the Cavendish, which resisted it.

8
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:37,120
现在，新菌株「热带 4 号」连香芽蕉也能杀死。
Now a new strain, Tropical Race 4, kills the Cavendish as well.

9
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:40,720
2019 年，它到了哥伦比亚。
In 2019, it reached Colombia.

10
00:00:40,800 --> 00:00:45,390
可地球上的香蕉，有一千多种。
Yet over 1,000 kinds of banana grow on Earth.

11
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:50,937
出路不是一根完美的香蕉，而是很多种。
The way out is not one perfect banana. It's many.

